        &kp BSLH   &kp N4  &kp N5    &kp N6     &kp EQUAL    &kp LEFT    &kp DOWN         &kp UP     &kp RIGHT        &kp CAPSLOCK
&trans  &kp GRAVE  &kp N1  &kp N2    &kp N3     &kp APOS     &kp END     &kp PG_DN        &kp PG_UP  &kp HOME         &kp SCROLLLOCK  &trans
